# .trivyignore — Acknowledged CVE exceptions for AzureShop
#
# Format: one CVE ID per line, optional trailing comment
# Trivy reads this file automatically when run from the repo root.
# For pipeline scans, mount this file into the container or pass --ignorefile.
#
# IMPORTANT: Every entry here must have a justification comment.
# Review and prune this list every quarter — "ignore" is not "won't fix forever".
#
# Template for new entries:
#   CVE-YYYY-XXXXX  # Package: x.y.z | Risk: accepted because... | Review by: YYYY-MM-DD

# Example entry (remove when real CVEs are added):
# CVE-2023-12345  # Package: some-lib 1.0.0 | No fix available | Risk: low in our config | Review: 2026-08-01
